  "permissionSemantics": "RN returns denied after the first RN-only denial. Original Tauri 2.11.5 reads its PluginPermStates cache and still reports prompt because RN did not populate that cache. Tauri observes RN OS grants as granted. The SDK preserves these upstream labels and does not write Tauri permission preferences. CAMERA and RECORD_AUDIO are intentionally undeclared in the unchanged original artifact: RN native request results are denied/never_ask_again without an OS prompt, exercising concurrent result routing and request-code reuse.",
